%%{init:{"theme":"neutral"}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  actor A as Auditor (Browser A)
  actor B as Co-Auditor (Browser B)
  participant YS as y-websocket\n(API gateway)
  participant IDB_A as IndexedDB (A)
  participant IDB_B as IndexedDB (B)
  participant DB as Postgres ledger

  A->>IDB_A: Persist Y.Doc update (offline)
  Note over A: Network offline

  B->>YS: Connect (token auth)
  YS->>B: Sync current Doc state
  B->>IDB_B: Persist update
  B->>YS: CRDT op (awareness update)
  YS->>DB: Emit working_paper.edited (signed)

  Note over A: Network restored
  A->>YS: Connect (token auth; RBAC check)
  YS->>A: Replay missed ops
  A->>IDB_A: Merge + persist
  A->>YS: Send offline ops (Y.applyUpdate)
  YS->>B: Broadcast merged ops
  YS->>DB: Emit working_paper.synced (signed, diff_summary)
